Description: real-time microphone noise suppression (RNNoise)
 Spectral creates a virtual microphone that runs a chosen input device
 through RNNoise denoising and voice-activity gating, so any application
 can select the cleaned microphone. It is a GUI control panel and a small
 background daemon, both talking to PipeWire directly.
 .
 The libraries winit loads at run time (xkbcommon, Wayland and the X11
 extensions) are listed by hand, since the linker cannot see them.
